#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/hydrosphere.md:1058
msgid "BATS snow albedo evolves snow surface age with temperature, melt/refreeze, and dust terms, then computes broadband albedo from visible and near-infrared components; age-based mode uses $\\alpha = \\alpha_{\\mathrm{old}} + ( \\alpha_{\\mathrm{fresh}} - \\alpha_{\\mathrm{old}} ) \\exp ( - \\mathrm{age} / \\tau ) .$"
msgstr "BATS 雪反照率以温度、融化/再冻结和尘埃项演化雪面年龄，再由可见光与近红外分量计算宽带反照率；基于年龄的模式使用 $\\alpha = \\alpha_{\\mathrm{old}} + ( \\alpha_{\\mathrm{fresh}} - \\alpha_{\\mathrm{old}} ) \\exp ( - \\mathrm{age} / \\tau ) .$"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/hydrosphere.md:1062
msgid "alpha_s is a typed diagnostic 0-cochain, absorbed shortwave fraction is $q_{\\mathrm{rad}} = \\star_{\\alpha} I_{\\mathrm{sw}}$ with $\\star_{\\alpha} = \\operatorname{diag} ( 1 - \\alpha_{s} ) \\geq 0$, and port power is $P_{\\mathrm{rad}} = I_{\\mathrm{sw}} \\cdot ( 1 - \\alpha_{s} ) .$"
msgstr "alpha_s 是 typed diagnostic 0-cochain，吸收短波分量为 $q_{\\mathrm{rad}} = \\star_{\\alpha} I_{\\mathrm{sw}}$，其中 $\\star_{\\alpha} = \\operatorname{diag} ( 1 - \\alpha_{s} ) \\geq 0$，port power 为 $P_{\\mathrm{rad}} = I_{\\mathrm{sw}} \\cdot ( 1 - \\alpha_{s} ) .$"

